title: Returning imported data to Org
pid: b778e2a3-8aa2-43e7-a160-1bf648569b39
body: |2-
  Skg can [[id:d305ce68-3989-42b9-8ae6-0fa431300307][export selected content to plain Org]]. This produces readable
  documents, not a restoration of the original Org-roam files. Keep the
  originals if you need their exact structure and metadata.

  The current export removes Skg metadata and rewrites ID links as file or
  headline links. It does not preserve node IDs, aliases, privacy sections,
  forks, or hides. Shared nodes and cycles can appear as
  link leaves rather than repeated subtrees. Reimporting cannot reconstruct
  the original graph; the existing Org-roam importer also requires file-level
  IDs that this export does not generate.

  For import instructions and replacement behavior, see
  [[id:24be6277-1953-4933-8ebe-384533d324de][import-org-roam in the command reference]].
contains:
- 223ad2f2-cb7b-4c7b-8979-efdd294d401a
